sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Chat as Copilot Chat
    participant Ext as MCP Auth Extension
    participant Kong as Kong Gateway
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant Kafka as Amazon MSK
    Dev->>Chat: List all topics on prod
    Chat->>Ext: Get auth session
    Ext-->>Chat: Bearer eyJhbGci...
    Chat->>Kong: POST /kafka/prod/mcp
    Note over Kong: JWT Validation
    Kong->>MCP: X-User-Email header
    MCP->>Kafka: list_topics()
    Kafka-->>MCP: [orders, payments, users]
    MCP-->>Kong: response
    Kong-->>Chat: 200 OK
    Chat-->>Dev: Found 3 topics
